{"sections":[{"slug":"幂等完备范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"幂等完备范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">幂等完备范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“幂等完备范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon X\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为幂等态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若存在子对象</span> $i\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及收缩</span> $r\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f=ir$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">分裂</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">所有幂等态射都分裂的范畴称为幂等完备范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">又称</span> Cauchy <span lang=\"zh\">完备范畴</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">幂等完备化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于小范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\overline{\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中可表函子的收缩构成的全子范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\overline{\\mathcal C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为幂等完备范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幂等完备化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幂等完备化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}